First run of optimize with central replica of PDFs. 

Built MySetForPip using 200 0f (nearly) 250 replicas.

Leads to small weights with N_eff = 920 at NNLO.

Leads to some large weights with N_eff = 50 at NLO. 

Worked as expected even if a N_eff = 920 it's a very big number of replica in contrast to the NLO case. 
This can be simply explained by the fact that at NNLO measurements are more accurate, then we need more replicas to represent the set. 
